    %% Shadow Mode: Parallel Testing Without Production Impact

    sequenceDiagram
        participant C as Client
        participant H as Handler
        participant Go as Go Router
        participant Rust as Rust Optimizer
        participant P1 as Provider (Go)
        participant P2 as Provider (Rust)
        participant L as Shadow Logger
        participant M as Metrics

        C->>H: POST /v1/infer
        activate H

        H->>H: Mode = shadow<br/>Sample Rate = 0.1<br/>rand() < 0.1 ✓

        par Primary Path (Go Router)
